aa143d-04c4-4f45-bee8-ffe41b98fd61'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Presciência', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edec0412-cd6c-4e12-9c94-9039b2ff1982'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Wanderratten', 'text': 'Während Deiner Versorgungsphase fügen die Wanderratten einem Gegner Deiner Wahl, dem sie vorher Schaden zugefügt haben, für jede Pestmarke, die auf ihnen liegt, 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nLege eine Pestmarke auf die Wanderratten, wenn sie einem Spieler während eines Angriffs Schaden zufügen.', 'type': 'Beschwörung von Ratten', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b878393-2e81-4a73-adc9-d128ff6e32b8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Alimañas apestadas', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02685cd2-3817-410f-aea6-9ff23677cb84'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Rongeurs malades', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b66a5bda-7bc9-4960-b563-800ce767a3a4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ratti Infetti', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '57532e2f-f616-49c1-96ca-9d987f9b9f7c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ratos Empestiados', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b51fd2b-41b1-4a72-b06a-6d8f99a07f6c'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Wilder Aesthir', 'text': 'Fliegend, Erstschlag\\n{W}{W}: +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Du kannst nicht mehr als {W}{W} auf diese Art pro Zug ausgeben.', 'type': 'Beschwörung eines Aesthirs', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c18440c-e2f4-457a-b9e4-149e90c7e7e8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Aesthir salvaje', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8fdc6198-7f64-4790-86c3-13474161df65'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Aeszir sauvage', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5941d305-29a0-4b3d-9f21-278733988f9e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Aesthir Selvatico', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '582ae91b-060b-4be9-9d06-84a145efb91a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Aesthir Selvagem', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87b410c2-6875-44af-89e8-5da091a704b2'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Wilder Aesthir', 'text': 'Fliegend, Erstschlag\\n{W}{W}: +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Du kannst nicht mehr als {W}{W} auf diese Art pro Zug ausgeben.', 'type': 'Beschwörung eines Aesthirs', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9cb80da2-d51b-440a-a9bd-57f4c7459b96'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Aesthir salvaje', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '80771482-cb04-4bcb-b13a-6d4350344f00'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Aeszir sauvage', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb00c96d-0c5a-4050-882e-3ab5ca6edba8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Aesthir Selvatico', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5a5e742-4710-4c80-bcd4-91a74fc9247f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Aesthir Selvagem', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42d19e79-9f95-4216-954f-cb69c9ec168d'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Willenskraft', 'text': 'Du kannst eine blaue Handkarte aus Deiner Hand aus dem Spiel entfernen und 1 Lebenspunkt bezahlen, anstatt die Spruchkosten der Willenskraft zu bezahlen.\\nEffekte, die Schaden verhindern oder umleiten, können hier nicht angewendet werden, um den Verlust der Lebenspunkte zu verhindern.\\nNeutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Unterbrechungszauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd656106-9c21-4da6-abef-7dce917f403f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Fuerza de voluntad', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'addb99b2-104e-4691-ba41-6da370953de1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Force de volonté', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5fd2e2a6-7110-4a49-9a66-e9757721501b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Forza di Volontà', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0625fecb-3318-4f17-b8f5-06a0f168b97c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Força de Vontade', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f1ec88b-e0e5-44ba-a16d-137c58ee7e33'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Winternacht\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein verschneites Land für Mana getappt wird, produziert es ein zusätzliches Mana desselben Typs und enttappt nicht während der nächsten Enttap-Phase seines Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Weltenverzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32efb4ec-7034-4123-9d3f-7effd67c27ff\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Noche invernal\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02862045-23dd-4e7b-a2cf-910138ccf276\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "La nuit de l\'Hiver", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45727559-0ab8-4b8b-bc89-7d47be283efc\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Notte d\'Inverno", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e3e59f4-c725-4610-ac4e-2f1be0eda652\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Noite de Inverno\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4267aa30-d497-4f51-9a35-066bd6b0fa2c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Yavimayaameisen', 'text': 'Verursachen Trampelschaden\\nKumulative Versorgung: {G}{G}\\nDie Yavimayaameisen können in dem Zug angreifen, in dem sie auf Deiner Seite ins Spiel kommen.', 'type': 'Beschwörung eines Schwarms', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a38feabb-1ff4-4558-b029-a984b1f8a4f5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Hormigas de Yavimaya', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4fff079-cb85-478a-8612-bbee4d95b828'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Fourmis de la Yavimaya', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1df45135-cdc6-4f70-95e0-241c878abe7a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Formiche di Yavimaya', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4fb91af-647f-4e65-ae74-2e912cc1e30b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Formigas de Yavimaya', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f450b9b9-afd4-482c-b116-bd6f4059f0fd'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Zersplitternder Wind', 'text': '{2}{G}: Der Zersplitternde Wind fügt einer Kreatur Deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nBringe einen Splitter-Spielstein ins Spiel. Behandle diesen Spielstein wie eine 1/1 fliegende grüne Kreatur mit Kumulativer Versorgung: {G}.\\nWenn dieser Spielstein das Spiel verläßt, fügt er Dir und jeder Kreatur, die Du kontrollierst, 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aff8dcc1-89e3-44b4-a5e9-910eafbd27b1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Nube de astillas', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a1197f75-caef-4c69-b8f7-b5101ef40018'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Bourrasque exfoliante', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1360e8dc-4a71-4529-a3c1-010597931415'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Vento di Schegge', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd5ff08a-c99d-4ecd-8bd7-346cd966f968'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Vento Estilhaçador', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b962cd2-e7fd-494c-b11f-5fa00888ac13'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Zorn der Natur', 'text': 'Zahle während Deiner Versorgungsphase {G}, oder begrabe den Zorn der Natur. Immer wenn ein Spieler einen Sumpf oder eine schwarze bleibende Karte ins Spiel bringt, opfert er einen Sumpf oder eine schwarze bleibende Karte.\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler eine Insel oder eine blaue bleibende Karte ins Spiel bringt, opfert er eine Insel oder eine blaue bleibende Karte.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d53f3ed-0cad-48f0-a8ce-c006a0c86b7e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ira de la naturaleza', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06e80b8e-c104-4f23-ab13-5da9db8cbdb5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Colère de la nature', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2b43a3d-37d3-4ba3-a4c8-de469343478d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ira della Natura', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33c448d5-3c8c-431d-865b-f8df1afab4ce'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ira da Natureza', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a42696d-0218-4fc0-9fbc-0caaa1930fea'}, 'multiverseid': None}]"]
printings: ['10E', '2XM', '6ED', '7ED', '8ED', '9ED', 'A25', 'ALL', 'ATH', 'BTD', 'C13', 'C16', 'CMA', 'CMR', 'CST', 'DDG', 'DDJ', 'DDL', 'DKM', 'DMR', 'DOM', 'EMA', 'G10', 'J14', 'JOU', 'LTC', 'ME1', 'ME2', 'ME3', 'ME4', 'MH1', 'MH2', 'MMQ', 'MP2', 'OLEP', 'OLGC', 'OTC', 'PAL00', 'PD2', 'PHJ', 'PLST', 'POR', 'PRM', 'PWOR', 'S99', 'SLC', 'SLD', 'TSB', 'VMA', 'VOC', 'WC02', 'WC97', 'WC99', 'WOC']
original_text: ['All creatures able to block Elvish Bard do so. If this forces a creature to block more attackers than allowed, defending player assigns that creature to block as many of those attackers as allowed.', 'All green creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'All non-artifact creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'As long as Juniper Order Advocate is untapped, all green creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'As long as enchanted creature is black, it gets +2/+1; otherwise, it gets -1/-2.', 'At the end of any combat in which Kjeldoran Home Guard attacked or blocked, put a -0/-1 counter on Kjeldoran Home Guard and put a Deserter token into play. Treat this token as a 0/1 white creature.', 'At the end of any turn, if Krovikan Horror is in your graveyard with a summon card directly above it, you may put Krovikan Horror into your hand.\\no1: Sacrifice a creature to have Krovikan Horror deal 1 damage to target creature or player.', "Attacking creatures cannot be blocked by only one creature this turn. Play only during combat before defense is chosen.\\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", 'Banding', 'Bury target artifact or land.', 'Bury target creature with power 4 or greater.', 'Bury target non-black, non-artifact creature or put a Zombie token into play. Treat this token as a 2/2 black creature.', "Can block creatures with flying. You may choose not to untap Whip Vine during your untap phase.\\noc\\nT: Tap target creature with flying blocked by Whip Vine. That creature does not untap during its controller's untap phase as long as Whip Vine remains tapped.", "Can block creatures with flying.\\nYou may choose not to untap Whip Vine during your untap phase.\\noc\\nT: Tap target creature with flying blocked by Whip Vine. That creature does not untap during its controller's untap phase as long as Whip Vine remains tapped.", 'Cannot be the target of spells or effects.', "Choose a card from your hand and shuffle that card into your library to draw two cards at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", "Choose and discard a red or green card from your hand to have target creature gain trample and get +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is equal to that creature's casting cost.", "Comes into play tapped.\\no1, oc\\nT: Search your library for a basic land and put it into play tapped. This does not count towards your one land per turn limit. Shuffle your library afterwards. At end of turn, return Thawing Glaciers to owner's hand.", "Counter target interrupt spell if it is blue.\\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", "Counter target spell. That spell's caster may draw up to two cards at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.\\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", 'Counts as a wall\\nIf Shield Sphere is assigned as a blocker, put a -0/-1 counter on it.', "Cumulative Upkeep: 1 life\\nDuring each player's upkeep, if that player controls any green or white permanents, he or she sacrifices a green or white permanent.", 'Cumulative Upkeep: Remove the top card of your library from the game. If you do not, remove your library from the game and bury Thought Lash.\\no0: Remove the top card of your library from the game to prevent 1 damage to you.', 'Cumulative Upkeep: o1o\\nW\\nAny damage that would reduce your life total to less than 1 instead reduces it to 1.', 'Cumulative Upkeep: o2\\nAny player may pay o2 or 2 life to counter target red or green spell. Play this ability as an interrupt. Effects that prevent or redirect damage cannot be used to counter this loss of life.', 'Cumulative Upkeep: o\\nG\\no2o\\nG: Pay 3 life for each velocity counter on Tornado. Destroy target permanent and put a velocity counter on Tornado. Use this ability only once each turn. Effects that prevent or redirect damage cannot be used to counter this loss of life.', "Cumulative Upkeep: o\\nW\\nWhenever a swamp, mountain, black permanent, or red permanent becomes tapped, Royal Decree deals 1 damage to that permanent's controller.", 'Death Spark deals 1 damage to target creature or player.\\nAt the end of your upkeep, if Death Spark is in your graveyard with a creature card directly above it, you may pay o1 to put Death Spark into your hand.', 'Destroy target artifact.\\nDestroy a target artifact for each o1o\\nR you pay in addition to the casting cost.\\nDestroy a target artifact and gain 1 life for each o1o\\nG you pay in addition to the casting cost.', 'Draw a card at the beginning of the upkeep of the turn after Bestial Fury comes into play.\\nIf enchanted creature attacks and is blocked, it gains trample and gets +4/+0 until end of turn.', "During each player's turn, that player may put one additional land into play.\\nWhenever a land is tapped for mana, return that land to owner's hand.", 'During your upkeep, Diseased Vermin deals 1 damage to a single target opponent it has previously damaged for each infection counter on Diseased Vermin.\\nIf Diseased Vermin damages a player in combat, put an infection counter on it.', "During your upkeep, pay o\\nG or bury Nature's Wrath.\\nWhenever a player puts a swamp or black permanent into play, he or she sacrifices a swamp or black permanent.\\nWhenever a player puts an island or a blue permanent into play, he or she sacrifices an island or blue permanent.", 'During your upkeep, sacrifice a forest, or bury Gargantuan Gorilla and Gargantuan Gorilla deals 7 damage to you. If you sacrifice a snow-covered forest in this way, Gargantuan Gorilla gains trample until end of turn.\\noc\\nT: Gargantuan Gorilla deals an amount of damage equal to its power to any other target creature. That creature deals an amount of damage equal to its power to Gargantuan Gorilla.', 'Each player shuffles his or her hand and graveyard into his or her library. Remove the top ten cards of your library from the game. Each player draws up to seven cards.', 'Enchanted creature cannot be blocked unless defending player pays an additional o3 for each creature assigned to block enchanted creature.', "Enchanted creature gets +1/+1.\\no1o\\nU: Return Viscerid Armor to owner's hand.", "Enchanted creature gets +1/+2.\\no2o\\nU: Switch Kjeldoran Pride from creature it enchants to another creature. Kjeldoran Pride's new target must be legal. Treat Kjeldoran Pride as though it were just cast on the new target.", 'First strike\\no1o\\nB: Regenerate', 'Flying', 'Flying, first strike\\no\\nWo\\nW: +2/+0 until end of turn. You cannot spend more than o\\nWo\\nW in this way each turn.', "Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on Phantasmal Sphere. During your upkeep, pay o1 for each of these +1/+1 counters or bury Phantasmal Sphere.\\nIf Phantasmal Sphere leaves play, put an Orb token into play under target opponent's control. Treat this token as a */* blue creature with flying, where * is equal to the number of these +1/+1 counters on Phantasmal Sphere.", 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a wage counter on Rogue Skycaptain. During your upkeep, pay o2 for each wage counter on Rogue Skycaptain, or remove all wage counters from Rogue Skycaptain and target opponent gains control of Rogue Skycaptain.', 'Flying\\nCannot be assigned to block.', 'Flying\\nDraw a card at the beginning of the upkeep of the turn after Carrier Pigeons comes into play.', "Flying\\nIf Ivory Gargoyle is put into the graveyard from play, put it into play under owner's control at end of turn and skip your next draw phase.\\no4o\\nW: Remove Ivory Gargoyle from the game.", 'Flying\\nIf Swamp Mosquito attacks and is not blocked, defending player gets a poison counter. If a player has ten or more poison counters, he or she loses the game.', 'Flying\\no\\nU: Remove the top card of your library from the game to tap target creature with flying.\\no\\nU: Remove the top card of your library from the game. If that card is a snow-covered land, Storm Elemental gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Gain 3 life.\\nGain 3 life for each o1o\\nG you pay in addition to the casting cost.', 'Guerrilla Tactics deals 2 damage to target creature or player.\\nIf a spell or effect controlled by an opponent causes you to discard Guerrilla Tactics from your hand, reveal Guerrilla Tactics to all players, and it deals 4 damage to target creature or player.', 'Hail Storm deals 2 damage to each attacking creature and 1 damage to you and each creature you control.', 'If Elvish Spirit Guide is in your hand, you may remove it from the game to add o\\nG to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'If Fyndhorn Druid is put into the graveyard the same turn it was blocked, gain 4 life.', "If Gustha's Scepter leaves play or you lose control of it, put all cards under Gustha's Scepter into your graveyard.\\noc\\nT: Put any card from your hand face down under Gustha's Scepter. You may look at that card at any time.\\noc\\nT: Return any card under Gustha's Scepter to your hand.", 'If Keeper of Tresserhorn attacks and is not blocked, it deals no damage to defending player this turn and that player loses 2 life. Effects that prevent or redirect damage cannot be used to counter this loss of life.', "If Phyrexian Devourer's power is 7 or greater, bury it.\\no0: Remove the top card of your library from the game to put a +X/+X counter on Phyrexian Devourer, where X is equal to that card's casting cost.", 'If Phyrexian War Beast leaves play, sacrifice a land, and Phyrexian War Beast deals 1 damage to you.', 'If Stromgald Spy attacks and is not blocked, you may choose to have it deal no damage to defending player this turn. If you do so, defending player must play with his or her hand face up on the table until Stromgald Spy leaves play.', 'If enchanted creature blocks or is blocked by any creatures, enchanted creature gets +0/+3 until end of turn and you gain 1 life.', 'If enchanted creature is put into the graveyard, draw three cards. Choose and discard one of those cards.', 'If enchanted creature is put into the graveyard, return that creature to play under your control as though it were just cast.', 'Look at the top five cards of your library. As many times as you choose, you may pay 1 life to put those cards on the bottom of your library and look at the top five cards of your library.\\nShuffle all but the top five cards of your library; put those five on top of your library in any order. Effects that prevent or redirect damage cannot be used to counter this loss of life.', 'No creatures deal damage in combat this turn. If you pay o2o\\nR in addition to the casting cost, Undergrowth does not affect red creatures.', 'Play on a creature you control.\\no0: Tap enchanted creature to give any other target creature +2/+1 until end of turn.', 'Play on a creature you control.\\no0: Untap enchanted creature. Use this ability only during your turn and only once each turn.\\no0: Tap enchanted creature to untap target artifact, creature, or land. Use this ability only if enchanted creature is white and only once each turn.', 'Play on a non-wall creature you control.\\nDraw a card at the beginning of the upkeep of the turn after Krovikan Plague comes into play.\\no0: Tap enchanted creature to have Krovikan Plague deal 1 damage to target creature or player. Put a -0/-1 counter on enchanted creature.', "Play only when a red sorcery or instant deals damage to you. Suffocation deals 4 damage to that spell's caster.\\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", 'Put a Knight token into play. Treat this token as a 1/1 white creature with banding.', "Put up to three target cards from an opponent's graveyard on top of his or her library in any order.", 'Put up to three target creature cards from your graveyard on top of your library in any order.', 'Rampage: 1\\nBalduvian War-Makers can attack the turn it comes into play on your side.', "Remove target non-white attacking creature from the game. Gain life equal to that creature's toughness.", "Return all islands to their owners' hands. Each player sacrifices a plains or a white permanent for each white permanent he or she controls.", 'Sacrifice a creature to gain control of target non-black, non-artifact creature.', "Search your library for any three cards and remove them from the game. Shuffle your library afterwards.\\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", "Target creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.\\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", "Target opponent chooses one: you draw three cards at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep; or you search your library for a card, put it into your hand, and then shuffle your library.", 'Target opponent chooses one: you draw three cards; or you choose and bury up to two target creatures that opponent controls and he or she draws up to three cards.', 'Target opponent chooses one: you put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control and gain 4 life; or you put a -1/-1 counter on each creature that opponent controls and Misfortune deals 4 damage to him or her.', "Trample, rampage: 1\\nCumulative Upkeep: Put a Survivor token into play under target opponent's control. Treat this token as a 1/1 red creature.", 'Trample, rampage: 2\\nCannot be blocked by fewer than three creatures.', 'Trample\\nCumulative Upkeep: o\\nGo\\nG\\nYavimaya Ants can attack the turn it comes into play on your side.', "Trample\\nDuring your upkeep, choose and discard a card from your hand, or bury Lim-Dûl's Paladin and draw a card.\\nIf any creatures are assigned to block it, Lim-Dûl's Paladin gets +6/+3 until end of turn.\\nIf Lim-Dûl's Paladin attacks and is not blocked, it deals no damage to defending player this turn and that player loses 4 life. Effects that prevent or redirect damage cannot be used to counter this loss of life.", "Trample\\no3: Banding until end of turn\\no3: All creatures banded with Urza's Engine gain trample until end of turn.", 'Untap any number of target creatures. Those creatures neither deal nor receive damage in combat this turn.', 'Until end of turn, you may redirect to target creature you control any amount of damage.', 'When Balduvian Horde comes into play, discard a card at random from your hand or bury Balduvian Horde.', 'When Balduvian Trading Post comes into play, sacrifice an untapped mountain or bury Balduvian Trading Post.\\noc\\nT: Add o1o\\nR to your mana pool.\\no1, oc\\nT: Balduvian Trading Post deals 1 damage to target attacking creature.', 'When Heart of Yavimaya comes into play, sacrifice a forest or bury Heart of Yavimaya.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'When Kjeldoran Outpost comes into play, sacrifice a plains or bury Kjeldoran Outpost.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nW to your mana pool.\\no1o\\nW, oc\\nT: Put a Soldier token into play. Treat this token as a 1/1 white creature.', 'When Lake of the Dead comes into play, sacrifice a swamp or bury Lake of the Dead.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nB to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT: Sacrifice a swamp to add o\\nBo\\nBo\\nBo\\nB to your mana pool.', 'When Lord of Tresserhorn comes into play, pay 2 life and sacrifice two creatures, and target opponent draws two cards. Effects that prevent or redirect damage cannot be used to counter this loss of life.\\no\\nB: Regenerate', 'When Sheltered Valley comes into play, bury any other Sheltered Valley you control.\\nDuring your upkeep, if you control three or fewer lands, gain 1 life.\\noc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.', 'When Sol Grail comes into play, choose a color.\\noc\\nT: Add one mana of the chosen color to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'When Soldevi Excavations comes into play, sacrifice an untapped island or bury Soldevi Excavations.\\noc\\nT: Add o1o\\nU to your mana pool.\\no1, oc\\nT: Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.', 'Whenever Soldevi Steam Beast becomes tapped, target opponent gains 2 life.\\no2: Regenerate', "Whenever a snow-covered land is tapped for mana, it produces one additional mana of the same type and does not untap during its controller's next untap phase.", "You may pay 1 life and remove a black card in your hand from the game instead of paying Contagion's casting cost. Effects that prevent or redirect damage cannot be used to counter this loss of life. Put two -2/-1 counters, distributed any way you choose, on any number of target creatures.", "You may pay 1 life and remove a blue card in your hand from the game instead of paying Force of Will's casting cost. Effects that prevent or redirect damage cannot be used to counter this loss of life.\\nCounter target spell.", "You may remove a green card in your hand from the game instead of paying Bounty of the Hunt's casting cost.\\nPut three +1/+1 counters, distributed any way you choose, on any number of target creatures. Remove these counters at end of turn.", "You may remove a red card in your hand from the game instead of paying Pyrokinesis's casting cost. Pyrokinesis deals 4 damage, divided any way you choose among any number of target creatures.", "You may remove a white card in your hand from the game instead of paying Scars of the Veteran's casting cost.\\nPrevent up to 7 damage to target creature or player. For each 1 damage to a creature prevented by Scars of the Veteran, put a +0/+1 counter on that creature at end of turn.", "o0: Varchild's Crusader cannot be blocked except by walls this turn. Bury Varchild's Crusader at end of turn.", "o1, oc\\nT: Sacrifice Astrolabe to add two mana of any one color to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt. Draw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", "o1, oc\\nT: Sacrifice Lodestone Bauble to put up to four target basic lands from any player's graveyard on top of his or her library in any order. That player draws a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", 'o1, oc\\nT: Target mana-producing land becomes a basic land type of your choice until end of turn.', "o1: Change Sworn Defender's power to the toughness of target creature blocking or being blocked by Sworn Defender, minus 1, until end of turn. Change Sworn Defender's toughness to 1 plus the power of that creature, until end of turn.", 'o1: Regenerate. Target opponent may draw a card.', 'o1o\\nB: Target player discards a card at random from his or her hand. Use this ability only when Insidious Bookworms is put into the graveyard from play. You cannot spend more than o1o\\nB in this way each turn.', 'o1o\\nG: Regenerate', 'o1o\\nW: Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.', 'o1o\\nW: Target non-attacking, non-blocking creature gets +0/+2 until end of turn.', 'o2: Mountainwalk until end of turn', 'o2: Put the top card of your graveyard on the bottom of your library.', 'o2: Remove the top card of your library from the game to gain 1 life.', 'o2: Remove the top two cards of your library from the game to have Whirling Catapult deal 1 damage to each creature with flying and each player.', 'o2o\\nG: Splintering Wind deals 1 damage to target creature. Put a Splinter token into play. Treat this token as a 1/1 green creature with flying and Cumulative Upkeep: o\\nG.\\nIf this token leaves play, it deals 1 damage to you and to each creature you control.', 'o2o\\nR: Remove target summon card in your graveyard from the game to put a Graveborn token into play. Treat this token as a 3/1 black and red creature that can attack the turn it comes into play. Bury Graveborn token at end of turn.', 'o2o\\nUo\\nU: Look at the top five cards of your library and put one of them into your hand. Remove the remaining four from the game.', 'o3, oc\\nT: Target player looks at the top three cards of his or her library and puts one of them on top of that library. Remove the remaining two from the game.', 'o3: Draw a card. Use this ability only when a creature is put into the graveyard from play, and only once for each creature put into the graveyard.', 'o3: Remove the top four cards of your library from the game to prevent all damage to you from one source.', 'o3: Target opponent looks at the top ten cards of your library and separates them into two face-down piles. Choose one of those piles and remove it from the game. Search the remaining pile and put one of those cards into your hand. Shuffle the remaining cards into your library. Ignore this effect if you have fewer than ten cards in your library.', "o\\nB: +1/-1 until end of turn\\no1o\\nU: Switch Phantasmal Fiend's power and toughness until end of turn. Effects that alter Phantasmal Fiend's power alter its toughness instead, and vice versa.", 'o\\nG: +1/-2 until end of turn', 'o\\nR, oc\\nT: Target player shuffles his or her library.', 'o\\nR: +1/+0 until end of turn', 'o\\nR: Add o\\nB to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'o\\nR: Remove the top card of your library from the game. If that card is a land, Chaos Harlequin gets -4/-0 until end of turn; otherwise, Chaos Harlequin gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'o\\nU: Regenerate\\nAt the end of any turn in which Spiny Starfish regenerated, put a Starfish token into play for each time it regenerated that turn. Treat these tokens as 0/1 blue creatures.', 'o\\nW, oc\\nT: Prevent up to 2 damage to any creature. Target opponent may draw a card.', "o\\nW: Flying until end of turn. Target opponent gains 2 life.\\no\\nU: Return Phelddagrif to owner's hand. Target opponent may draw a card.\\no\\nG: Trample until end of turn. Put a Hippo token into play under target opponent's control. Treat this token as a 1/1 green creature.", 'o\\nW: Pay 1 life to prevent up to 2 damage to any creature. Effects that prevent or redirect damage cannot be used to counter this loss of life.\\no\\nU: Prevent 1 damage to any Cleric or Wizard.\\no\\nB: Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature you control to prevent up to 2 damage to any player.', 'o\\nWo\\nG: Choose and discard a card from your hand to have target creature gain banding, first strike, or trample or get a +1/+1 counter.', "o\\nX, oc\\nT: Put the top card of target opponent's library into his or her graveyard. Continue doing this until you have put X cards or a creature card into that graveyard, whichever occurs first. If the last card put into the graveyard is a creature card, bury Helm of Obedience and put that creature into play under your control as though it were just cast. X cannot be equal to 0.", 'o\\nXo\\nXo1, oc\\nT: Tap X target lands.', 'o\\nXo\\nXo1: Destroy target non-creature artifact with casting cost equal to X.', 'oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\no2, oc\\nT: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', "oc\\nT: Sacrifice Mishra's Groundbreaker. Target land becomes a 3/3 artifact creature. That creature still counts as a land.", "oc\\nT: Sacrifice Scarab of the Unseen to return all enchantments on target permanent you own to their owners' hand. Draw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", "oc\\nT: Sacrifice a black or artifact creature to add an amount of o\\nB equal to that creature's casting cost to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt.", 'oc\\nT: Sacrifice a creature and a swamp to bury target non-artifact creature.\\noc\\nT: Sacrifice a creature and a snow-covered swamp to bury target creature.', 'oc\\nT: Sacrifice two lands to draw three cards. Choose and discard one of those cards.', 'oc\\nT: Untap target tapped land an opponent controls to add one mana of any type that land produces to your mana pool.']
